          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 SW                MARSWORTH           CHURCH LANE 6/93                                        Horseshoe Cottage - GV                                          II House.  One C17 bay, extended to front late C18 and C19 to form L-plan, with C18 bay to rear, possibly once an outbuilding, and C20 single storey extension in angle.  Front to road is of whitewashed brick with timber truss in left gable, old tile roof, and rebuilt brick chimneys. 2 storeys, 2 bays.  Left bay is gabled to front and has C20 3-light leaded casements with segmental heads.  Board door to right in timber- framed porch.  Right bay has off-set eaves and 2-light C20 casements, the lower leaded and with a segmental head.  Shallow full-height lean-to of whitewashed brick to left.  Interior of C17 bay has timber frame with large curved braces, a stop-chamfered spine beam, and a large chimney stack in line with winder stair. Listing NGR: SP9196314525"
    }
  ],
